event: turn
data: {"agent":"dsh","type":"thinking","text":"The user asks a one-sentence answer: in a multi-agent platform, what reliability problem should be prioritized first? No tools needed. Just answer in one sentence. Context: \"relay-deck\" working directory, but they want a one-liner. I should give a concise, opinionated answer.\n\nThe most critical reliability problem: the absence of a deterministic, idempotent execution/state layer — i.e., tasks get lost or duplicated across agent handoffs because there's no durable, replayable state machine with idempotency keys and exactly-once semantics.\n\nOne sentence, in Chinese."}

event: turn
